      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261213">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261215">SSE2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261217">Compare low double precision floating-point values in xmm1 and xmm2/mem64 and set the EFLAGS flags accordingly.</para>
      </td>
